1042 0 obj
  << /ActualText (     EXPERIENCE\n  \n     Apple \057 Visual Designer\n     Cupertino \055 Los Angeles\054 CA  2018 \055 Present\n\nExpanded into hands\055on front\055end development\054 using AI tools \050Claude\051 to translate designs into working code\054 building and debugging live web\057mobile experiences in HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\056\nLed the visual design of multiple App and Game Collections on the App Store\054 shaping cohesive visual systems from concept to production\056\nPartnered with cross\055functional teams on major launches\054 delivering content across all devices\056\nWorked with creative agencies and artists on art directions\056 )
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1043 0 R
     /Pg 1038 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
