1050 0 obj
  << /ActualText (     SEPHORA \057 Designer\n     Shanghai\054 China\015 05\0562012 \055 09\0562014\n\nDesigned and tested product landing pages and marketing emails\054 collaborating with the merchandise team to create assets \055 from photo shoots\054 retouching to final visual integration\056 Partnered closely with developers to implement functional and visually cohesive components across digital experiences\056 \nLed the creation of monthly product catalogs from concept to final production\054 managing vendor relationships and overseeing print quality\054 materials\054 and color accuracy to maintain the highest standards\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1051 0 R
